{"type":"message","id":"848291fd","parentId":"ee867560","timestamp":"2026-04-01T17:03:46.634Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2Bwlzwa4CeBI2wy5pQScMWxg|fc_0c9cc6d6377935420169cd4ff1c8d08191bd342bdbc89392d8","toolName":"memory_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cb53571912e36014200692f4245b6b88c3fd26ca811ca3fb6d5aaa719f345c9f\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 21,\n      \"endLine\": 42,\n      \"score\": 0.8384338811075842,\n      \"textScore\": 0.8384338811075842,\n      \"snippet\": \"发现了0个值得关注的实战问题（主要是API使用指南文档）\\n\\n#### Discord OpenClaw 社区（方向3）\\n无法访问（GitHub discussions被禁用），未发现新讨论\\n\\n#### 插件仓库（方向4）\\n发现了2个相关问题：\\n- **#57536** - feishu plugin鉴权失败\\n- **#57452** - Telegram media download被SSRF guard拦截\\n\\n### 结论和建议\\n**最高优先级是#57551（kimi无限递归重试）和#57550（HTTP API Token认证失败）**，都是2026.3.28的严重regression：\\n- #57551导致edit工具完全失效，token被无限消耗\\n- #57550导致所有RESTful HTTP API集成中断\\n\\n**建议**：aoao立即处理这两个P0问题，同时关注4个P1问题。\\n\\n### 备注\\n- 项目跟踪文件已更新（OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\\n- 扫描数据完整，但无法发送给 main agent（session 不可用或超时）\\n- 建议手动审查 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中的新扫描记录\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L21-L42\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L21-L42\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"83f855485033bfc27f820a2cf1ec2e15953a62f586bdd289ff73b36a1439cfb3\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 76,\n      \"endLine\": 86,\n      \"score\": 0.8246548870674301,\n      \"textScore\": 0.8246548870674301,\n      \"snippet\": \"- main（No session found with label: main）\\n     - agent:main:main（timeout）\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 建议后续行动\\n\\n- 检查 main session 的正确标识符或启动方式\\n- 或者通过其他渠道（如飞书消息）通知 main\\n- 当前扫描结果已保存在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中，可供查看\\n\\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L76-L86\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L76-L86\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"314c4fef474029164365235bb6496c9d0a6c3f3f3ceed6ac5ff8d296acb5424c\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1547,\n      \"endLine\": 1570,\n      \"score\": 0.8170218435854146,\n      \"textScore\": 0.8170218435854146,\n      \"snippet\": \"#### P0 - 紧急问题\\n\\n**#56816** - Gateway crashes on provider WebSocket disconnect (code 1005) — no reconnect attempt\\n- **类型**：bug + crash\\n- **严重度**：极高（Gateway 每天崩溃 50+ 次）\\n- **root cause**：SafeGatewayPlugin 的 `maxReconnectAttempts: 0` 导致任何 WebSocket 断开都触发崩溃\\n- **影响**：Gateway 持续崩溃，所有服务和通道中断，Control UI 和 in-flight requests 被干扰\\n- **可修性**：M（需要修改 SafeGatewayPlugin 的重连逻辑）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（设置合理的 maxAttempts，添加指数退避）\\n\\n#### P1 - 高优先级问题\\n\\n**#56846** - `nodes` tool unavailable in Telegram group session despite being in sandbox allow list\\n- **类型**：bug / regression\\n- **严重度**：高（nodes 工具完全不可用，即使配置正确）\\n- **root cause**：工具注册逻辑问题，runtime 警告 nodes 是 \\\"shipped core tool but unavailable in the current runtime/provider/mod\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1547-L1570\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1547-L1570\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"89d927bec654302ca52a170a5f526d6551df7a53b1a7985022d02aa1530ad458\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 36,\n      \"endLine\": 85,\n      \"score\": 0.814974948635632,\n      \"textScore\": 0.814974948635632,\n      \"snippet\": \"5. **#58430** - Feishu TTS: 语音消息应发送为 audio 类型而非 file 类型\\n   - 类型：bug\\n   - 影响：Feishu TTS 消息类型错误\\n\\n### InStreet 社区 ❌\\n- 原因：域名解析失败（instreet.coze 无法解析）\\n- 发现：无\\n\\n### Discord 社区 ❌\\n- 原因：Discussions 404\\n- 发现：无\\n\\n### 插件仓库 ❌\\n- 原因：openclaw-weixin 仓库不存在或无法访问\\n- 发现：无\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 结论与建议\\n\\n**最高优先级：#58437（Live session model switch 死锁）**\\n- 问题：升级到 2026.3.28 后 agent 进入无限重试循环并死锁\\n- 建议：aoao 立即处理\\n\\n**次优先级：#58457（Ollama Cloud provider 鉴权失效）**\\n- 问题：Ollama Cloud provider 即使使用有效 API key 也返回 401 错误\\n- 建议：aoao 优先修复\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 已完成的交付\\n\\n1. ✅ 更新了 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件\\n   - 添加了新的扫描结果（2026-03-31 16:14 UTC）\\n   - 更新了当前优先级表格（新增 5 个问题）\\n\\n2. ❌ sessions_send 到 main 失败\\n   - 错误：timeout\\n   - 尝试的 sessionKey：\\n     - main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abee\\n\\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ae850a0bcf73dab31c179b78e75089fad216dbd40752405c2868297bb85e2c47\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 844,\n      \"endLine\": 874,\n      \"score\": 0.7877501387570416,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7877501387570416,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **严重度**：中（webchat UX 问题）\\n- **root cause**：webchat 前端无法渲染图像，即使后端返回了图像数据\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. read tool 返回图像时，webchat 不显示\\n  2. 用户无法通过 webchat 查看图像\\n- **可修性**：M（需要在 webchat message renderer 中添加 image support）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2026-03-30 00:42 UTC 扫描\\n\\n### 扫描摘要\\n- **时间范围**：2026-03-29 22:42 UTC → 00:42 UTC（过去 120 分钟）\\n- **新 open issues**：5 个（已排除已覆盖项）\\n- **状态**：发现 1 个 P0 级别严重问题，2 个 P1 级别问题，2 个 P2 级别问题\\n\\n### 关键发现\\n\\n#### P0 - Critical 问题\\n\\n**#57349** - [Bug]: Heap exhaustion after extended uptime — OOM during filesystem scan\\n- **类型**：bug\\n- **严重度**：极高（Gateway 频繁崩溃，长时间运行后 OOM）\\n- **root cause**：Gateway 运行 ~17-20 小时后，JavaScript heap 增长到 ~4GB 并 OOM，崩溃发生在 `AfterScanDir` 文件系统扫描操作期间，webchat UI 打开时崩溃加速（~15 分钟）\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L844-L874\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L844-L874\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ec15f3d0da1c23485ba8db6a8ce9f593ad5dbac2ffb2dfda1149d138fa469360\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 871,\n      \"endLine\": 892,\n      \"score\": 0.7877501387570416,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7877501387570416,\n      \"snippet\": \"2. 中断活跃 sessions 并丢失 in-flight agent work\\n  3. Webchat 用户看到重复断线，长时间 session 不可用\\n- **可修性**：M（需要排查内存泄漏源：node.list polling、Browser CDP sessions、Filesystem scans、Session context）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（高优先级）\\n- **log snippet**：`FATAL ERROR: Reached heap limit Allocation failed - JavaScript heap out of memory`\\n- **stack trace**：`node::fs::AfterScanDir(uv_fs_s*)`\\n\\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\\n\\n**#57334** - [Bug]: Memory-core session indexer skips .jsonl.reset and .jsonl.deleted files — most past sessions invisible to search\\n- **类型**：bug + regression\\n- **严重度**：高（跨 session memory recall 失效）\\n- **root cause**：`listSessionFilesForAgent` 函数使用 `.filter((name) => name.endsWith(\\\".jsonl\\\"))` 过滤文件，排除了 `.jsonl.reset.*` 和 `\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L871-L892\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L871-L892\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"94505b8fd2affdb180753202d8749750a9aaabf1f0ce62c536a6ce00f58caaa3\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1,\n      \"endLine\": 31,\n      \"score\": 0.7684100759536899,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7684100759536899,\n      \"snippet\": \"# 扫描报告发送记录 [2026-03-30 06:55 UTC]\\n\\n## 发送状态：失败\\n\\n### 尝试发送给 main agent\\n- Session key 1: `main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → 失败（No session found）\\n- Session key 2: `agent:main:main` → 失败（timeout）\\n\\n### 扫描数据（已记录在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\\n\\n#### GitHub Issues（方向1）\\n发现了85个新候选（过去2小时内更新），其中最重要的是：\\n- **#57551** - [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了（P0，regression）\\n- **#57550** - [Bug]: v3.28+ HTTP API broken: pure Token auth throws \\\"missing scope: operator.write\\\"（P0，regression）\\n- **#57540** - Isolated cron sessions fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError（P1）\\n- **#57538** - claude-haiku-4-5 missing from bundled catalog（P1，silent cost regression 5-6x）\\n- **#57536** - [Bug]: feishu:tenant_a\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fc401265377b8fb90da71779894d08c92cf96e08d2fb754c4649ad8439e5a888\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1565,\n      \"endLine\": 1588,\n      \"score\": 0.7535800764699399,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7535800764699399,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n\\n**#56832** - Intermittent deactivated_workspace after /new (session reset race with previous embedded run) !!!\\n- **类型**：regression + bug\\n- **严重度**：高（内部错误泄露给用户）\\n- **root cause**：会话重置时与正在进行的 embedded run 存在 race condition\\n- **影响**：用户看到原始 JSON 内部错误 `{\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"code\\\":\\\"deactivated_workspace\\\"}}`，UX 严重受损\\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复会话清理和 abort ordering）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n\\n**#56841** - Custom OpenAI-compatible provider works via direct /v1/chat/completions, but OpenClaw 2026.3.28 always fails with \\\"Connection error\\\"\\n- **类型**：bug\\n- **严重度**：高（完全阻塞 OpenAI 兼容的 provider）\\n- **root cause**：网络请求层的问题，直接调用 `/v1/chat/completions` 成功，但通过 OpenClaw 失败\\n- **影响**：用户无法使用自定义 OpenAI 兼容 provider\\n- **可修性**：M（需要排查网络\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1565-L1588\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1565-L1588\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"14545e74a6351aa7bdc6889ffb29ff354b34eafe05fe5fa40e938e7cf41fdc04\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1250,\n      \"endLine\": 1271,\n      \"score\": 0.7425191622545174,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7425191622545174,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **root cause**：stopLaunchAgent() 使用 `launchctl bootout` 而不是 `launchctl stop`\\n- **影响**：每次 stop 后都需要重新运行 `openclaw gateway install` 才能再次 start，破坏自动化重启脚本和 watchdog 恢复系统\\n- **可修性**：S（替换 `bootout` 为 `stop`）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n\\n**#57115** - Gateway startup hangs when previous process exists as zombie (PID alive but port not listening)\\n- **类型**：bug\\n- **严重度**：高（无法启动 gateway）\\n- **root cause**：Gateway lock 检测只检查 PID 存在，没有检查端口是否实际监听\\n- **影响**：当 gateway 进程变成僵尸状态时，无法启动新的 gateway，命令无限挂起\\n- **可修性**：M（需要增强 lock 检测逻辑，添加端口健康检查）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n\\n**#57133** - [Bug]: NO_REPLY envelope leakage - agent self-talk and internal tokens delivered to Telegram as visible messages\\n- **类型**：bug + regression\\n- **严重度**：中高（（202\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1250-L1271\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1250-L1271\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"df76b15cb27ecea6760464029d8942a5a6939ce8a09ce366cdf664833766d924\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1896,\n      \"endLine\": 1901,\n      \"score\": 0.7366217064658024,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7366217064658024,\n      \"snippet\": \"| 56839 | bug+privacy/data leak | WhatsApp gateway sends message to Telegram user ID interpreted as phone number during config recovery | P0 | 未覆盖 | Telegram user ID 被当作 WhatsApp phone number，隐私和数据泄露 |\\n| 56854 | bug+regression+crash | Gateway crashes with uncaught exception when Discord health monitor triggers stale-socket restart | P0 | 未覆盖 | abort handler 和 health-monitor restart race condition，gateway 崩溃 |\\n| 57134 | bug+regression | Isolated cron jobs fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError on 2026.3.28 | P1 | 未覆盖 | cron runner 在 isolated 模式下有模型切换错误，所有 isolated cron jobs 失败 |\\n| 57141 | bug | [Bug]: Telegram DM topic ACP bind fails on next message with missing ACP metadata | P1 | 未覆盖 | Teleg\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1896-L1901\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1896-L1901\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"provider\": \"none\",\n  \"citations\": \"auto\",\n  \"mode\": \"fts-only\"\n}"}],"details":{"results":[{"id":"cb53571912e36014200692f4245b6b88c3fd26ca811ca3fb6d5aaa719f345c9f","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md","startLine":21,"endLine":42,"score":0.8384338811075842,"textScore":0.8384338811075842,"snippet":"发现了0个值得关注的实战问题（主要是API使用指南文档）\n\n#### Discord OpenClaw 社区（方向3）\n无法访问（GitHub discussions被禁用），未发现新讨论\n\n#### 插件仓库（方向4）\n发现了2个相关问题：\n- **#57536** - feishu plugin鉴权失败\n- **#57452** - Telegram media download被SSRF guard拦截\n\n### 结论和建议\n**最高优先级是#57551（kimi无限递归重试）和#57550（HTTP API Token认证失败）**，都是2026.3.28的严重regression：\n- #57551导致edit工具完全失效，token被无限消耗\n- #57550导致所有RESTful HTTP API集成中断\n\n**建议**：aoao立即处理这两个P0问题，同时关注4个P1问题。\n\n### 备注\n- 项目跟踪文件已更新（OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\n- 扫描数据完整，但无法发送给 main agent（session 不可用或超时）\n- 建议手动审查 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中的新扫描记录\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L21-L42","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L21-L42"},{"id":"83f855485033bfc27f820a2cf1ec2e15953a62f586bdd289ff73b36a1439cfb3","path":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md","startLine":76,"endLine":86,"score":0.8246548870674301,"textScore":0.8246548870674301,"snippet":"- main（No session found with label: main）\n     - agent:main:main（timeout）\n\n---\n\n## 建议后续行动\n\n- 检查 main session 的正确标识符或启动方式\n- 或者通过其他渠道（如飞书消息）通知 main\n- 当前扫描结果已保存在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中，可供查看\n\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L76-L86","source":"memory","citation":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L76-L86"},{"id":"314c4fef474029164365235bb6496c9d0a6c3f3f3ceed6ac5ff8d296acb5424c","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1547,"endLine":1570,"score":0.8170218435854146,"textScore":0.8170218435854146,"snippet":"#### P0 - 紧急问题\n\n**#56816** - Gateway crashes on provider WebSocket disconnect (code 1005) — no reconnect attempt\n- **类型**：bug + crash\n- **严重度**：极高（Gateway 每天崩溃 50+ 次）\n- **root cause**：SafeGatewayPlugin 的 `maxReconnectAttempts: 0` 导致任何 WebSocket 断开都触发崩溃\n- **影响**：Gateway 持续崩溃，所有服务和通道中断，Control UI 和 in-flight requests 被干扰\n- **可修性**：M（需要修改 SafeGatewayPlugin 的重连逻辑）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（设置合理的 maxAttempts，添加指数退避）\n\n#### P1 - 高优先级问题\n\n**#56846** - `nodes` tool unavailable in Telegram group session despite being in sandbox allow list\n- **类型**：bug / regression\n- **严重度**：高（nodes 工具完全不可用，即使配置正确）\n- **root cause**：工具注册逻辑问题，runtime 警告 nodes 是 \"shipped core tool but unavailable in the current runtime/provider/mod\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1547-L1570","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1547-L1570"},{"id":"89d927bec654302ca52a170a5f526d6551df7a53b1a7985022d02aa1530ad458","path":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md","startLine":36,"endLine":85,"score":0.814974948635632,"textScore":0.814974948635632,"snippet":"5. **#58430** - Feishu TTS: 语音消息应发送为 audio 类型而非 file 类型\n   - 类型：bug\n   - 影响：Feishu TTS 消息类型错误\n\n### InStreet 社区 ❌\n- 原因：域名解析失败（instreet.coze 无法解析）\n- 发现：无\n\n### Discord 社区 ❌\n- 原因：Discussions 404\n- 发现：无\n\n### 插件仓库 ❌\n- 原因：openclaw-weixin 仓库不存在或无法访问\n- 发现：无\n\n---\n\n## 结论与建议\n\n**最高优先级：#58437（Live session model switch 死锁）**\n- 问题：升级到 2026.3.28 后 agent 进入无限重试循环并死锁\n- 建议：aoao 立即处理\n\n**次优先级：#58457（Ollama Cloud provider 鉴权失效）**\n- 问题：Ollama Cloud provider 即使使用有效 API key 也返回 401 错误\n- 建议：aoao 优先修复\n\n---\n\n## 已完成的交付\n\n1. ✅ 更新了 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件\n   - 添加了新的扫描结果（2026-03-31 16:14 UTC）\n   - 更新了当前优先级表格（新增 5 个问题）\n\n2. ❌ sessions_send 到 main 失败\n   - 错误：timeout\n   - 尝试的 sessionKey：\n     - main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abee\n\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85","source":"memory","citation":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85"},{"id":"ae850a0bcf73dab31c179b78e75089fad216dbd40752405c2868297bb85e2c47","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":844,"endLine":874,"score":0.7877501387570416,"textScore":0.7877501387570416,"snippet":"- **严重度**：中（webchat UX 问题）\n- **root cause**：webchat 前端无法渲染图像，即使后端返回了图像数据\n- **影响**：\n  1. read tool 返回图像时，webchat 不显示\n  2. 用户无法通过 webchat 查看图像\n- **可修性**：M（需要在 webchat message renderer 中添加 image support）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n---\n\n## 2026-03-30 00:42 UTC 扫描\n\n### 扫描摘要\n- **时间范围**：2026-03-29 22:42 UTC → 00:42 UTC（过去 120 分钟）\n- **新 open issues**：5 个（已排除已覆盖项）\n- **状态**：发现 1 个 P0 级别严重问题，2 个 P1 级别问题，2 个 P2 级别问题\n\n### 关键发现\n\n#### P0 - Critical 问题\n\n**#57349** - [Bug]: Heap exhaustion after extended uptime — OOM during filesystem scan\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：极高（Gateway 频繁崩溃，长时间运行后 OOM）\n- **root cause**：Gateway 运行 ~17-20 小时后，JavaScript heap 增长到 ~4GB 并 OOM，崩溃发生在 `AfterScanDir` 文件系统扫描操作期间，webchat UI 打开时崩溃加速（~15 分钟）\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L844-L874","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L844-L874"},{"id":"ec15f3d0da1c23485ba8db6a8ce9f593ad5dbac2ffb2dfda1149d138fa469360","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":871,"endLine":892,"score":0.7877501387570416,"textScore":0.7877501387570416,"snippet":"2. 中断活跃 sessions 并丢失 in-flight agent work\n  3. Webchat 用户看到重复断线，长时间 session 不可用\n- **可修性**：M（需要排查内存泄漏源：node.list polling、Browser CDP sessions、Filesystem scans、Session context）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（高优先级）\n- **log snippet**：`FATAL ERROR: Reached heap limit Allocation failed - JavaScript heap out of memory`\n- **stack trace**：`node::fs::AfterScanDir(uv_fs_s*)`\n\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\n\n**#57334** - [Bug]: Memory-core session indexer skips .jsonl.reset and .jsonl.deleted files — most past sessions invisible to search\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：高（跨 session memory recall 失效）\n- **root cause**：`listSessionFilesForAgent` 函数使用 `.filter((name) => name.endsWith(\".jsonl\"))` 过滤文件，排除了 `.jsonl.reset.*` 和 `\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L871-L892","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L871-L892"},{"id":"94505b8fd2affdb180753202d8749750a9aaabf1f0ce62c536a6ce00f58caaa3","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md","startLine":1,"endLine":31,"score":0.7684100759536899,"textScore":0.7684100759536899,"snippet":"# 扫描报告发送记录 [2026-03-30 06:55 UTC]\n\n## 发送状态：失败\n\n### 尝试发送给 main agent\n- Session key 1: `main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → 失败（No session found）\n- Session key 2: `agent:main:main` → 失败（timeout）\n\n### 扫描数据（已记录在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\n\n#### GitHub Issues（方向1）\n发现了85个新候选（过去2小时内更新），其中最重要的是：\n- **#57551** - [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了（P0，regression）\n- **#57550** - [Bug]: v3.28+ HTTP API broken: pure Token auth throws \"missing scope: operator.write\"（P0，regression）\n- **#57540** - Isolated cron sessions fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError（P1）\n- **#57538** - claude-haiku-4-5 missing from bundled catalog（P1，silent cost regression 5-6x）\n- **#57536** - [Bug]: feishu:tenant_a\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31"},{"id":"fc401265377b8fb90da71779894d08c92cf96e08d2fb754c4649ad8439e5a888","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1565,"endLine":1588,"score":0.7535800764699399,"textScore":0.7535800764699399,"snippet":"- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#56832** - Intermittent deactivated_workspace after /new (session reset race with previous embedded run) !!!\n- **类型**：regression + bug\n- **严重度**：高（内部错误泄露给用户）\n- **root cause**：会话重置时与正在进行的 embedded run 存在 race condition\n- **影响**：用户看到原始 JSON 内部错误 `{\"detail\":{\"code\":\"deactivated_workspace\"}}`，UX 严重受损\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复会话清理和 abort ordering）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#56841** - Custom OpenAI-compatible provider works via direct /v1/chat/completions, but OpenClaw 2026.3.28 always fails with \"Connection error\"\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：高（完全阻塞 OpenAI 兼容的 provider）\n- **root cause**：网络请求层的问题，直接调用 `/v1/chat/completions` 成功，但通过 OpenClaw 失败\n- **影响**：用户无法使用自定义 OpenAI 兼容 provider\n- **可修性**：M（需要排查网络\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1565-L1588","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1565-L1588"},{"id":"14545e74a6351aa7bdc6889ffb29ff354b34eafe05fe5fa40e938e7cf41fdc04","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1250,"endLine":1271,"score":0.7425191622545174,"textScore":0.7425191622545174,"snippet":"- **root cause**：stopLaunchAgent() 使用 `launchctl bootout` 而不是 `launchctl stop`\n- **影响**：每次 stop 后都需要重新运行 `openclaw gateway install` 才能再次 start，破坏自动化重启脚本和 watchdog 恢复系统\n- **可修性**：S（替换 `bootout` 为 `stop`）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#57115** - Gateway startup hangs when previous process exists as zombie (PID alive but port not listening)\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：高（无法启动 gateway）\n- **root cause**：Gateway lock 检测只检查 PID 存在，没有检查端口是否实际监听\n- **影响**：当 gateway 进程变成僵尸状态时，无法启动新的 gateway，命令无限挂起\n- **可修性**：M（需要增强 lock 检测逻辑，添加端口健康检查）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#57133** - [Bug]: NO_REPLY envelope leakage - agent self-talk and internal tokens delivered to Telegram as visible messages\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：中高（（202\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1250-L1271","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1250-L1271"},{"id":"df76b15cb27ecea6760464029d8942a5a6939ce8a09ce366cdf664833766d924","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1896,"endLine":1901,"score":0.7366217064658024,"textScore":0.7366217064658024,"snippet":"| 56839 | bug+privacy/data leak | WhatsApp gateway sends message to Telegram user ID interpreted as phone number during config recovery | P0 | 未覆盖 | Telegram user ID 被当作 WhatsApp phone number，隐私和数据泄露 |\n| 56854 | bug+regression+crash | Gateway crashes with uncaught exception when Discord health monitor triggers stale-socket restart | P0 | 未覆盖 | abort handler 和 health-monitor restart race condition，gateway 崩溃 |\n| 57134 | bug+regression | Isolated cron jobs fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError on 2026.3.28 | P1 | 未覆盖 | cron runner 在 isolated 模式下有模型切换错误，所有 isolated cron jobs 失败 |\n| 57141 | bug | [Bug]: Telegram DM topic ACP bind fails on next message with missing ACP metadata | P1 | 未覆盖 | Teleg\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1896-L1901","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1896-L1901"}],"provider":"none","citations":"auto","mode":"fts-only"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775063026634}}
