ses custom env vars on npm global update | {级 | 未覆盖 | npm global update 时 LaunchAgent plist 被重新生成，用户自定义的环境变量没有保留，Gateway 启动失败 |\\n| 57063 | regression+性能问题 | [Regression] v2026.3.28 inverts model fallback logic and leaks session modelOverrides, causing massive latency | P0 | 未覆盖 | 模型回退逻辑被反转，session modelOverrides 泄漏到子/cron 会话，导致 massive latency（59-second wait，lane congestion） |\\n| 57026 | 基础设施问题 | [infra] OLLAMA_API_KEY missing — Gateway startup blocker (1642x repeated) | P0 | 未覆盖 | OLLAMA_API_KEY 环境变量缺失，Gateway 无法启动 |\\n| 56839 | bug+privacy/data leak | WhatsApp gateway sends message to Telegram user ID interpreted as phone number during config recovery | P0 | 未覆盖 | Telegram user ID 被当作 WhatsApp phone number，隐私和数据泄露 |\\n| 56854 | bug+regression+crash | Gateway crashes with uncaught exception when Discord health monitor triggers stale-socket restart | P0 | 未覆盖 | abort handler 和 health-monitor restart race condition，gateway 崩溃 |\\n| 57134 | bug+regression | Isolated cron jobs fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError on 2026.3.28 | P1 | 未覆盖 | cron runner 在 isolated 模式下有模型切换错误，所有 isolated cron jobs 失败 |\\n| 57141 | bug | [Bug]: Telegram DM topic ACP bind fails on next message with missing ACP metadata | P1 | 未覆盖 | Telegram DM topic 绑定到 ACP session 后，routed thread session row 缺少 ACP metadata 和 sessionFile |\\n| 57131 | bug+regression | [Bug]: gateway stop uses launchctl bootout instead of launchctl stop (macOS) | P1 | 未覆盖 | stopLaunchAgent() 使用 launchctl bootout 而不是 launchctl stop，Gateway 无法重启 |\\n| 57115 | bug | Gateway startup hangs when previous process exists as zombie (PID alive but port not listening) | P1 | 未覆盖 | Gateway lock 检测只检查 PID 存在，没有检查端口是否实际监听，无法启动新的 gateway |\\n| 57133 | bug+regression | [Bug]: NO_REPLY envelope leakage - agent self-talk and internal tokens delivered to Telegram as visible messages | P1 | 未覆盖 | 2026.3.24 上的 delivery-mirror 没有正确抑制 NO_REPLY 和 agent self-talk（2026.3.28 已修复） |\\n| 57062 | bug+regression | [Bug]: /model reports configured model, not actual runtime model after fallback | P1 | 未覆盖 | /model 命令显示配置的模型，而不是实际运行的模型（fallback 后），用户无法知道实际使用的模型 |\\n| 57011 | bug+regression | [Bug]: 2026.3.28 breaks builtin memory on update: status multimodal validation failure + missing memory-tool.runtime dist chunk | P1 | 未覆盖 | 升级到 2026.3.28 后，memory 功能完全失效（status 验证失败 + 缺少 dist chunk） |\\n| 57069 | bug | [Bug] Cron hour field 0-3 parsed as 19-22 (19-hour shift) | P1 | 未覆盖 | cron 表达式中 hour field 值 0-3 被错误解析，被加了 19 小时（0 → 19, 1 → 20, 2 → 21, 3 → 22） |\\n| 57059 | bug | [Bug] imageModel 配置已启用 vision-model 但调用时报错 No media-understanding provider | P1 | 未覆盖 | media-understanding provider 未正确注册（尽管模型配置了 input: [\\\"text\\\", \\\"image\\\"]），image 工具完全失效 |\\n| 57052 | bug | [Bug]: Gateway shutdown timeout leaves lock file, preventing restart (macOS + Linux) | P1 | 未覆盖 | Gateway 关闭超时时没有清理 lock file，无法重启 |\\n| 57540 | bug+regression | Isolated cron sessions fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError when cron model differs from agent primary | P1 | 未覆盖 | cron payload.model 被忽略，只能使用 agent primary 模型（来源：GitHub issues） |\\n| 57538 | bug+regression | claude-haiku-4-5 missing from bundled Anthropic model catalog — silent Sonnet fallback on cron runs | P1 | 未覆盖 | bundled catalog 缺少 haiku，cron 指定 Haiku 时静默回退到 Sonnet（cost +5-6x）（来源：GitHub issues） |\\n| 57536 | bug+regression | [Bug]: feishu:tenant_access_token获取失败，返回400错误 | P1 | 未覆盖 | 升级到 2026.3.28 后 feishu plugin 鉴权失败（来源：GitHub issues） |\\n| 57452 | bug | [Bug]: Telegram media download fails with \\\"Blocked: resolves to private/internal/special-use IP address\\\" for large files | P1 | 未覆盖 | SSRF guard 拦截 Telegram media download（来源：GitHub issues） |\\n| 57188 | bug+regression | [Bug]: 2026.3.28 update breaks gateway on Linux VPS/systemd — recovery fails, required snapshot restore | P1 | 未覆盖 | gateway install 使用 systemctl --user（headless 环境不可用），doctor --repair 无法修复，gateway 死亡 |\\n| 57221 | bug+regression | [Bug]: After upgrade to 2026.3.28 from 2026.3.24, it shows channels.feishu: invalid config: must NOT have additional properties | P1 | 未覆盖 | 升级后 Feishu channel 配置验证失败，无法启动 openclaw |\\n| 57201 | bug+regression | [Bug]: Telegram channel silently fails to initialize / no polling on 2026.3.28 (macOS) | P1 | 未覆盖 | Telegram channel 初始化失败，没有开始 polling，logs 中无任何 Telegram 相关行 |\\n| 57195 | bug+crash | Discord gateway crashes on WS close code 1005 due to race condition in abort/reconnect path | P1 | 未覆盖 | abort/reconnect 路径中的 race condition，WebSocket close code 1005 时 reconnect 逻辑抛出未捕获异常 |\\n| 57186 | bug | voice-call: EADDRINUSE on port 3334 — tool/CLI tries to start webhook server already owned by gateway | P2 | 未覆盖 | gateway 已启动 webhook 服务器，tool/CLI 尝试在同一端口启动第二个服务器 |\\n| 57157 | bug | [Bug] /summary command hardcodes qwen3.3-30B as default model, cannot be configured via openclaw.json | P2 | 未覆盖 | src/cmds/summary.ts 中硬编码 qwen3.3-30B，用户无法通过 config 设置默认值 |\\n| 57219 | bug | plugins.allow allowlist silently blocks bundled Telegram channel plugin | P2 | 未覆盖 | plugins.allow allowlist 错误地阻塞了内置的 Telegram channel plugin |\\n| 57215 | bug | [Bug]: image tool does not resolve relative paths against workspaceDir | P2 | 未覆盖 | 相对路径被解析为 process.cwd() 而不是 workspaceDir |\\n| 57173 | bug+docs gap | [Bug] OpenClaw Core Schema Incompatible with Official Feishu Plugin | P2 | 未覆盖 | core schema 与官方 @larksuite/openclaw-lark 不兼容 |\\n| 57181 | bug | SSRF guard blocks BlueBubbles plugin internal API calls to private IP | P2 | 未覆盖 | SSRF protection 错误地拦截了插件的内部 HTTP 调用 |\\n| 57232 | security | Security: Caller-provided tools can shadow built-in tools, bypassing server-side execution | P0 | 未覆盖 | 调用者提供的工具可以 shadow 内置工具，绕过服务器端执行，纯名称匹配，无警告 |\",\n  \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\"\n}"}],"details":{"text":"| 57562 | bug+regression | [Bug]: bug-report-openclaw-upgrade-config-migration.pdf | P1 | 未覆盖 | 配置迁移失败（相关 #57567）（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 57558 | bug | [Bug] Configuration UI silently reverts changes and ignores API keys in openclaw.json | P1 | 未覆盖 | 配置管理失效（相关 PR #57527）（来源