repository_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw\\\",\\n      \\\"labels_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57950/labels{/name}\\\",\\n      \\\"comments_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57950/comments\\\",\\n      \\\"events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57950/events\\\",\\n      \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57950\\\",\\n      \\\"id\\\": 4174237888,\\n      \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"I_kwDOQb6kR874zdDA\\\",\\n      \\\"number\\\": 57950,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"[Bug]: browser.request missing at runtime even though browser plugin is loaded\\\",\\n      \\\"user\\\": {\\n        \\\"login\\\": \\\"nitin-goodpower\\\",\\n        \\\"id\\\": 256211160,\\n        \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"U_kgDOD0V42A\\\",\\n        \\\"avatar_url\\\": \\\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256211160?v=4\\\",\\n        \\\"gravatar_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/nitin-goodpower\\\",\\n        \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/nitin-goodpower\\\",\\n        \\\"followers_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/nitin-goodpower/followers\\\",\\n        \\\"following_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/nitin-goodpower/following{/other_user}\\\",\\n        \\\"gists_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/nitin-goodpower/gists{/gist_id}\\\",\\n        \\\"starred_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/nitin-goodpower/starred{/owner}{/repo}\\\",\\n        \\\"subscriptions_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/nitin-goodpower/subscriptions\\\",\\n        \\\"organizations_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/nitin-goodpower/orgs\\\",\\n        \\\"repos_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/nitin-goodpower/repos\\\",\\n        \\\"events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/nitin-goodpower/events{/privacy}\\\",\\n        \\\"received_events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/nitin-goodpower/received_events\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"User\\\",\\n        \\\"user_view_type\\\": \\\"public\\\",\\n        \\\"site_admin\\\": false\\n      },\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": 9706244967,\\n          \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACQomLZw\\\",\\n          \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/labels/bug\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n          \\\"color\\\": \\\"d73a4a\\\",\\n          \\\"default\\\": true,\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"Something isn't working\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": 10321003530,\\n          \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACZy4ECg\\\",\\n          \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/labels/bug:crash\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"bug:crash\\\",\\n          \\\"color\\\": \\\"B60205\\\",\\n          \\\"default\\\": false,\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"Process/app exits unexpectedly or hangs\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"state\\\": \\\"open\\\",\\n      \\\"locked\\\": false,\\n      \\\"assignees\\\": [],\\n      \\\"milestone\\\": null,\\n      \\\"comments\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-03-30T21:39:03Z\\\",\\n      \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2026-04-01T16:51:58Z\\\",\\n      \\\"closed_at\\\": null,\\n      \\\"assignee\\\": null,\\n      \\\"author_association\\\": \\\"NONE\\\",\\n      \\\"issue_field_values\\\": [],\\n      \\\"type\\\": null,\\n      \\\"active_lock_reason\\\": null,\\n      \\\"sub_issues_summary\\\": {\\n        \\\"total\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"completed\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"percent_completed\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"issue_dependencies_summary\\\": {\\n        \\\"blocked_by\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"total_blocked_by\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"blocking\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"total_blocking\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"### Bug type\\\\n\\\\nCrash (process/app exits or hangs)\\\\n\\\\n### Beta release blocker\\\\n\\\\nNo\\\\n\\\\n### Summary\\\\n\\\\nVersion: OpenClaw 2026.3.28 (f9b1079)\\\\n\\\\nWhat I expected:\\\\nAfter enabling browser support and restarting the gateway, openclaw browser status should work and the gateway should expose browser.request.\\\\n\\\\nWhat happened:\\\\nopenclaw browser status fails with:\\\\n```\\\\nGatewayClientRequestError: unknown method: browser.request\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nWhat I verified:\\\\n\\\\n• browser.enabled = true\\\\n• browser plugin is loaded\\\\n• openclaw plugins inspect browser shows it declares:\\\\n  • service: browser-control\\\\n  • method: browser.request\\\\n• gateway was restarted cleanly:\\\\n  • openclaw gateway stop\\\\n  • pkill -f openclaw\\\\n  • openclaw gateway start\\\\n• still same error\\\\n\\\\nSetup:\\\\n• macOS\\\\n• Brave configured as browser executable\\\\n• Brave existing-session profile configured\\\\n• issue occurs even before attach succeeds, because gateway method is missing entirely\\\\n\\\\nRepro:\\\\n```\\\\nopenclaw browser status\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nActual result:\\\\n```\\\\nGatewayClientRequestError: unknown method: browser.request\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### Steps to reproduce\\\\n\\\\nVersion: OpenClaw 2026.3.28 (f9b1079)\\\\n\\\\nWhat I expected:\\\\nAfter enabling browser support and restarting the gateway, openclaw browser status should work and the gateway should expose browser.request.\\\\n\\\\nWhat happened:\\\\nopenclaw browser status fails with:\\\\n```\\\\nGatewayClientRequestError: unknown method: browser.request\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nWhat I verified:\\\\n\\\\n• browser.enabled = true\\\\n• browser plugin is loaded\\\\n• openclaw plugins inspect browser shows it declares:\\\\n  • service: browser-control\\\\n  • method: browser.request\\\\n• gateway was restarted cleanly:\\\\n  • openclaw gateway stop\\\\n  • pkill -f openclaw\\\\n  • openclaw gateway start\\\\n• still same error\\\\n\\\\nSetup:\\\\n• macOS\\\\n• Brave configured as browser executable\\\\n• Brave existing-session profile configured\\\\n• issue occurs even before attach succeeds, because gateway method is missing entirely\\\\n\\\\nRepro:\\\\n```\\\\nopenclaw browser status\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nActual result:\\\\n```\\\\nGatewayClientRequestError: unknown method: browser.request\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### Expected behavior\\\\n\\\\nThe browser.request method should not fail. \\\\n\\\\n### Actual behavior\\\\n\\\\nVersion: OpenClaw 2026.3.28 (f9b1079)\\\\n\\\\nWhat I expected:\\\\nAfter enabling browser support and restarting the gateway, openclaw browser status should work and the gateway should expose browser.request.\\\\n\\\\nWhat happened:\\\\nopenclaw browser status fails with:\\\\n```\\\\nGatewayClientRequestError: unknown method: browser.request\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nWhat I verified:\\\\n\\\\n• browser.enabled = true\\\\n• browser plugin is loaded\\\\n• openclaw plugins inspect browser shows it declares:\\\\n  • service: browser-control\\\\n  • method: browser.request\\\\n• gateway was restarted cleanly:\\\\n  • openclaw gateway stop\\\\n  • pkill -f openclaw\\\\n  • openclaw gateway start\\\\n• still same error\\\\n\\\\nSetup:\\\\n• macOS\\\\n• Brave configured as browser executable\\\\n• Brave existing-session profile configured\\\\n• issue occurs even before attach succeeds, because gateway method is missing entirely\\\\n\\\\nRepro:\\\\n```\\\\nopenclaw browser status\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nActual result:\\\\n```\\\\nGatewayClientRequestError: unknown method: browser.request\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### OpenClaw version\\\\n\\\\n2026.3.28\\\\n\\\\n### Operating system\\\\n\\\\nmacOS 26.2 (Tahoe)\\\\n\\\\n### Install method\\\\n\\\\ncurl -fsSL https://openclaw.ai/install.sh | bash\\\\n\\\\n### Model\\\\n\\\\nopenai/gpt5.4\\\\n\\\\n### Provider / routing chain\\\\n\\\\nopenai api key\\\\n\\\\n### Additional provider/model setup details\\\\n\\\\n_No response_\\\\n\\\\n### Logs, screenshots, and evidence\\\\n\\\\n```shell\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### Impact and severity\\\\n\\\\n_No response_\\\\n\\\\n### Additional information\\\\n\\\\n_No response_\\\",\\n      \\\"reactions\\\": {\\n        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57950/reactions\\\",\\n        \\\"total_count\\\": 5,\\n        \\\"+1\\\": 5,\\n        \\\"-1\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"laugh\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"hooray\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"confused\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"heart\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"rocket\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"eyes\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"timeline_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57950/timeline\\\",\\n      \\\"performed_via_github_app\\\": null,\\n      \\\"state_reason\\\": null,\\n      \\\"pinned_comment\\\": null,\\n      \\\"score\\\": 1\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58356\\\",\\n      \\\"repository_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw\\\",\\n      \\\"labels_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58356/labels{/name}\\\",\\n      \\\"comments_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58356/comments\\\",\\n      \\\"events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58356/events\\\",\\n      \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58356\\\",\\n      \\\"id\\\": 4178565038,\\n      \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"I_kwDOQb6kR875D9eu\\\",\\n      \\\"number\\\": 58356,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"[Bug]: system.run.prepare broken after update to v2026.3.28 — downgrade to v2026.3.24 does not fix\\\",\\n      \\\"user\\\": {\\n        \\\"login\\\": \\\"boejoe66-hash\\\",\\n        \\\"id\\\": 272502181,\\n        \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"U_kgDOED4NpQ\\\",\\n        \\\"avatar_url\\\": \\\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/272502181?v=4\\\",\\n        \\\"gravatar_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/boejoe66-hash\\\",\\n        \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/boejoe66-hash\\\",\\n        \\\"followers_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/boejoe66-hash/followers\\\",\\n        \\\"following_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/boejoe66-hash/following{/other_user}\\\",\\n        \\\"gists_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/boejoe66-hash/gists{/gist_id}\\\",\\n        \\\"starred_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/boejoe66-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}\\\",\\n        \\\"subscriptions_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/boejoe66-hash/subscriptions\\\",\\n        \\\"organizations_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/boejoe66-hash/orgs\\\",\\n        \\\"repos_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/boejoe66-hash/repos\\\",\\n        \\\"events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/boejoe66-hash/events{/privacy}\\\",\\n        \\\"received_events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/boejoe66-hash/received_events\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"User\\\",\\n        \\\"user_view_type\\\": \\\"public\\\",\\n        \\\"site_admin\\\": false\\n      },\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": 9706244967,\\n          \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACQomLZw\\\",\\n          \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/labels/bug\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n          \\\"color\\\": \\\"d73a4a\\\",\\n          \\\"default\\\": true,\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"Something isn't working\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"state\\\": \\\"open\\\",\\n      \\\"locked\\\": false,\\n      \\\"assignees\\\": [],\\n      \\\"milestone\\\": null,\\n      \\\"comments\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-03-31T11:59:21Z\\\",\\n      \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2026-04-01T16:43:37Z\\\",\\n      \\\"closed_at\\\": null,\\n      \\\"assignee\\\": null,\\n      \\\"author_association\\\": \\\"NONE\\\",\\n      \\\"issue_field_values\\\": [],\\n      \\\"type\\\": null,\\n      \\\"active_lock_reason\\\": null,\\n      \\\"sub_issues_summary\\\": {\\n        \\\"total\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"completed\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"percent_completed\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"issue_dependencies_summary\\\": {\\n        \\\"blocked_by\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"total_blocked_by\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"blocking\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"total_blocking\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"### Bug type\\\\n\\\\nRegression (worked before, now fails)\\\\n\\\\n### Beta release blocker\\\\n\\\\nNo\\\\n\\\\n### Summary\\\\n\\\\nAfter OpenClaw auto-updated from v2026.3.24 to v2026.3.28 on 2026-03-29, \\\\nthe exec tool via the paired macOS node stopped working. Downgrading CLI \\\\nand App back to v2026.3.24 does NOT restore functionality.\\\\n\\\\n### Steps to reproduce\\\\n\\\\n1. Update OpenClaw from v2026.3.24 to v2026.3.28\\\\n2. Check node capabilities: exec disappears from Caps\\\\n3. Run: openclaw nodes run --node <id> -- ls ~/Downloads\\\\n4. Error appears immediately\\\\n\\\\n### Expected behavior\\\\n\\\\nexec/system.run should work as it did with v2026.3.24 before the update.\\\\n\\\\n### Actual behavior\\\\n\\\\nEnvironment\\\\n- OpenClaw CLI: v2026.3.24 (downgraded) / was v2026.3.28\\\\n- OpenClaw App: v2026.3.24\\\\n- macOS: 26.4.0 (Build 25E246)\\\\n- Hardware: MacBook Air M1 (MacBookAir10,1)\\\\n- Install method: npm (CLI) + brew cask (App)\\\\n- \\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5289135caf0fa12b\\\">>>\"\n}"}],"details":{"url":"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+updated:>=2026-04-01T15:03:00Z+label:bug&per_page=15&sort=updated&order=desc","finalUrl":"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+updated:>=2026-04-01T15:03:00Z+label:bug&per_page=15&sort=updated&order=desc","status":200,"contentType":"application/json","extractMode":"text","extractor":"json","externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_fetch","wrapped":true},"truncated":true,"length":12000,"rawLength":11229,"wrappedLength":12000,"fetchedAt":"2026-04-