{"type":"message","id":"572fc328","parentId":"9145f620","timestamp":"2026-04-01T17:04:53.964Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Searching for plugin repository**\n\nI need to find a plugin repository, so I’m considering searching for \"openclaw-weixin\" issues on GitHub. It might be helpful to look across repositories to see if one already exists. I'll also specifically search the openclaw/openclaw-weixin repository for any issues that were updated within the last two hours. This could give me a clue about new developments related to the plugin I’m looking for. Let's see how that goes!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0c9cc6d6377935420169cd50323aa08191b981da2676251f5b\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpzVA111B6Dr_0ogG0ADwqKeWeiBci5g7ZljytX82B8b6wraELAjH_adClesJ3K8mUjYWQVHwHdE1OKVLESs9LlXRY7YwvbM_0X3miQwEjW0ZGEhwkC4RK3OQU1cUAaIZvjONE3oHJEEy6Cv9Mhew4xMxu5Z1z_Xz2TxPETUnBygdID9V4yZVPvn2RQcHDAtV-fMKhyD46z-FP3CY_M_dshsjZ3b-iffqG3Yi72HFVmRdH-QjEAw43fqmVq4sysk_oCJZ4SA_F1ciBa_pWBb3ECa1RdlH4EnSs_8HZ1fVino0cMOy9uxc62xWVD_W6JvlYWJ7v2sNkO_O7jHuUK9spnYVW2O4en9Z2xXyqkKHXMl7l5XIYZtfniMN2iBJDjPczDAI89m7SO7tTqf0_qS9V6CIQLAuwvtdpjkMKGAnjVwLcoqBYFy-ug49XCDySMv6S22DWcl87_Bgha1z9Fkx79ITsMAcLSwUZBy3U8ocKjM-RVxZ9aBAQvSq3jUTB-CbNFTzQT4jV6ppzbcb3WFUdvx7tsMXp5xVjys0l9Ga7x-dTTZPo-mKsZLbu1f-dYCybqZPr3OaJpCa2EyFfXIQw_eIdhweIZeElnhW7gOAJgXrIx1WUd9KECSq2VvjdRE2Av8h4Nnk4UQ5HHz2eYGvLSroGWQ9wVTCXdIMQrWUzRtThZuG4OtwzPpWuV28V6-0VnWPbUAPbG-ab8-TroTXTi9Rgb9FpVlr4MpV8mglNbisnxhPifs280g26_2hD4Xt7KCIbXJMzMjJ_Jsjv_xR-GEX1C46Wk095OX_JSwEcD75UV6rKHI9puYZgsR38PNPDlgfBX9Gtgqlz9C2vTV0tuhDHA0kCSXf5CeMPRsz2uUlNp9lgjJ8wEkYdmqpxf89ZoK7m6OUS_e2S4qWPjh_SpsOz02Jgp7HmVEftcb02z5zN-cFmQlrqh909eBodXQ0pwygkrUnZiLDJSF7naXdUQMXZ14XKTZjnj_v7ecPc0wk6V7gt_R2EWeBJ09tPAhx1k5a91biZRLdWA3aiHkf6-0DlX2trNEpca7_r4WDVYO-ztEA=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Searching for plugin repository**\\n\\nI need to find a plugin repository, so I’m considering s